                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">RUN ORDER
Run BASELINE, wait for completion. Run OPTIMISATION next. Run VERIFICATION only after a completed design.
Use SHOW toggles for one preview at a time. Field=0 means FEM stress but design density. Field=1 means displacement.
Scale affects display only. Set the same positive legend maximum to compare a physical field.
Save job folders for reports. Mode 2 Source is a completed engineering result, not a mesh.
No automatic building-code, buckling or connection verification.</item>
